# Forever Survival Hunter, Melee (provisional: no in-game check yet; Raptor Strike queued on the next swing, Mongoose
# Bite's window from the usability read, the hawks and the target's mark modelled from our casts): Aspect of the Beast
# and Hunter's Mark before combat; Raptor Strike queued whenever ready and Mongoose Bite in its window at tier 1,
# Hunter's Mark on a new target at tier 2; then Strider Kick, two Summon Hawk guardians and Wing Clip as the filler
# (after wowsims/forever's Melee APL, reference only; Immolation Trap left out). The melee strikes only in melee range.
# Wing Clip's mana floor is a setting, off by default.

actions.precombat=aspect_of_the_beast,if=!buff.aspect_of_the_beast.up
actions.precombat+=/hunters_mark,if=!debuff.hunters_mark.up
actions=raptor_strike,use_off_gcd=1,focus=1
actions+=/aspect_of_the_beast,if=!buff.aspect_of_the_beast.up
actions+=/hunters_mark,focus=2,if=!debuff.hunters_mark.up
actions+=/call_action_list,name=melee,if=action.raptor_strike.in_range
actions.melee=mongoose_bite,focus=1
actions.melee+=/strider_kick
actions.melee+=/summon_hawk,if=pet.hawk.count<2
actions.melee+=/wing_clip,if=mana.pct>=settings.wing_clip_mana
